@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-33 - Filter/Search Orders

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "My Orders / Admin Purchases UI" as FE
control "PaymentController" as API
control "PaymentService" as Service
database "MongoDB: bills" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-33
FE -> API: GET /payments/orders?filters
API -> Service: Execute Filter/Search Orders
Service -> DB: Read/write bills
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Kết quả lọc orders hiển thị

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Không có kết quả -> empty state
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đang ở trang orders
Post: Kết quả lọc orders hiển thị
Main flow:
1. Admin nhập từ khóa hoặc chọn filter (status, date range)
2. System gọi API GET /payments/orders?status=CONFIRMED&from=...&to=...
3. System trả về kết quả đã lọc
end note
@enduml
